{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dive into a wacky tropical adventure!</strong> \ud83c\udf34</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The cruise ship has sunk \u2014 just the perfect vacation, right? Now five heroes \u2014 Brandt, Zhe Kai, Basil, Daphne, and Naila \u2014 have somehow survived and washed up on the mysterious Laau Luka islands. Alongside your loyal friends Rico and Kipu, you'll need to help these castaways survive, avoid sunburn, and keep them from befriending sharks. The friendly chief Tikitiki welcomes them, but the suspicious shaman Zoc is already giving side-eyes. Secrets, adventures, and tropical cocktails await! \ud83c\udf79\ud83c\udf3a\ud83d\udd25</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique Gameplay</strong> \u2013 A blend of cooking and strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Funny and Engaging Storyline</strong> \u2013 Keeps you hooked with humor and twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Variety of Characters</strong> \u2013 Meet a wide range of quirky personalities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bonus Content</strong> \u2013 Unlock wallpapers, music, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>5 Unique Islands</strong> \u2013 Explore different environments, each with its own charm.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3577420?t=1743136040","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3577420?t=1743136040","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577420/873f9bee778e4059865e8824bbf814c62d4551dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743136040","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577420/873f9bee778e4059865e8824bbf814c62d4551dd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743136040","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"F